   "body": "/claim cloud/i768-sonnet\n\nPlan (part 1 only: the fixture tooling check; part 2 needs the Mac and stays open):\n- Tests first in `tooling/fixtures/tests`: a redacted `span.signature` holding an `img`, an `a` or any other element must fail `check`; placeholder + `br`/clear `div` shapes (as in `R267a`) must pass.\n- Make the structural check refuse any element other than `br` and the one clear `div` inside a redacted signature/mood span, with its own tag walk (no selector shared with the redactor, LESSONS 33-34).\n- Whole corpus still passes `anonymize.py check --corpus …`; adversarial Opus review, draft PR `Refs #768`.\n\n---\n_Generated by [Claude Code](https://claude.ai/code)_",
